{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "d5f60b2d-64ba-893e-b350-ee053432e84b",
  "created_at": "2026-01-12T18:28:53-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Sarah Tran",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T18:23:54-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Lorraine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T18:23:58-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, hi. I know it's after six, City Hall's closed, but this is the storm number, right? Somebody told me to call this one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T18:24:09-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right, this line stays open for storm issues. What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T18:24:15-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Storm drain in front of my house is backed up. Water's over the curb and across the whole sidewalk. It's been like that since Saturday. Two days. That's the way it goes, I guess, but I'm sick of it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T18:24:32-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'm sorry about that. Let me get the address. Where are you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T18:24:38-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "395 Callender Avenue. North End."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T18:24:41-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "395 Callender Avenue. And this is from the coastal storm, Friday into Saturday?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T18:24:47-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that one. Rain stopped Saturday and the water just sat there. It's Monday. Still sitting."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T18:24:55-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So the drain's not taking anything, and the water is over the curb and onto the sidewalk. Is it getting toward your house or the driveway at all?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T18:25:08-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Driveway edge. Not in the house. But a delivery truck got stuck in it this afternoon. Had to get towed out, or close to it. Driver was cursing up a storm. Blocked the street for a half hour."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T18:25:25-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that's no good. A delivery truck stuck in the water, near your driveway. Was anyone hurt?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T18:25:33-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, nobody hurt. Just stuck. Look, there's one more thing. The manhole cover out there. It looks off to me. Sitting maybe an inch high on one side. Wasn't like that before."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T18:25:47-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A manhole cover sitting about an inch off, on the same stretch as the drain. Is it in the road where cars are driving over it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T18:25:59-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right in the travel lane. Cars hit it, you hear it clunk. Water's all around it so you can't really see it unless you know."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T18:26:10-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'm putting that down as a separate item so it gets looked at too. Does it move or rattle when a car goes over, or just clunk?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T18:26:23-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Clunks. Don't know if it moves. I'm not standing in the road to find out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T18:26:30-05:00",
      "duration": 24,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, please don't. Stay on the sidewalk. Now, let me read this back. Storm drain at 395 Callender Avenue backed up since Saturday, water over the curb and across the sidewalk, a delivery truck got stuck today, and a manhole cover in the travel lane sitting about an inch high. Did I get that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T18:26:54-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. Yep."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T18:26:56-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. And is this the best number for you? I have the one you're calling from."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T18:27:04-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0157. That's my cell."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T18:27:07-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0157. Got it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T18:27:09-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So when's somebody coming? Because I called, well, I figured somebody'd be out by now. Everybody's got water on this road and nobody showed."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T18:27:20-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. After a storm like this the crews work through a long list, and drains that are fully blocked get pushed up. I'll mark this one with the truck and the manhole so it's flagged. I'd expect someone out within the next day or so."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T18:27:40-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Next day or so. Okay. Do the crews work weekends? Because Saturday and Sunday, nothing. Not a soul."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T18:27:48-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "They do come out on weekends when it's storm related, but they go where the calls are heaviest first. I can't tell you why your street wasn't reached over the weekend. I'll note that nobody had been by."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T18:28:05-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, well. My uncle always said, ask twice and write down the name. So, what's yours again?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T18:28:13-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Lorraine. L-O-R-R-A-I-N-E. Medeiros, M-E-D-E-I-R-O-S."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T18:28:16-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Lorraine Medeiros. Got it. Writing it on the back of an envelope."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T18:28:22-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. And if you call back, tell them it's logged tonight, Monday, about six twenty-five, for Callender Avenue, and mention the manhole cover."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T18:28:33-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Six twenty-five, Monday. Callender. Manhole. Fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T18:28:36-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "If the water starts coming toward the house, or the cover shifts or goes, call right back. Keep people and kids away from it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T18:28:47-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Will do. Thanks, Lorraine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T18:28:50-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Take care, Ms. Tran."
    }
  ],
